up>-</sup></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-nrix\">Ar</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-nrix\">Ca<sup>+2</sup></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-nrix\">Protons</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-nrix\">17</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-nrix\">18</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-nrix\">20</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Electrons</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">18</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">18</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">18</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>Nuclear charge means number of protons present in the nucleus. Here maximum number of protons present in the Ca<sup>+2</sup> ion, so the attraction towards those 18 electrons wll be most by the nucleus of the Ca<sup>+2</sup> ion. That is why size of the Ca<sup>+2</sup> ion wll be least because of highest nuclear charge."},"hi":{"content":"Cl<sup>–</sup>,  Ar और Ca<sup>2+</sup> के समान-इलेक्ट्रॉनिक प्रजातियों के आकार पर प्रभाव :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"बाहरी कक्षियों में इलेक्ट्रॉन-इलेक्ट्रॉन अंतरक्रिया से"},{"identifier":"B","content":"मूल्यमानी क्वांटम संख्या से"},{"identifier":"C","content":"नाभिकीय आवेश से"},{"identifier":"D","content":"मूल्यमानी क्वांटम संख्या के अज़ीमुथल संख्या से"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"eso2oclGrXSeMCidWb1LU","permalink":"the-size-of-the-iso-electronic-species-cl-ar-and-ca2-is-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-an0mbwfgr13pc1d3","updated_time":1568532196,"timeAllotted":120000,"paperId":"jee-main-2019-online-8th-april-morning-slot","topic":"effective-nuclear-charge","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2019-online-8th-april-morning-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","chapter":"periodic-table-and-periodicity","year":2019,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"diff